{
  "notes": [
    "The flip gate for vesper-resonance (aspect ci flip-gate --, SH6 lane 1,",
    "#1396; this crate's lane: SH6 lane 9, #1404). The flipped modules are the",
    "SVF kernel render and PID controller (kernels.rs), the built-in graph runner",
    "and schedule compiler (pdc.rs), and the confinement verifier (confine.rs).",
    "The package has only their port; their frozen Rust is the seed's engine,",
    "which the compiler links until Stage 2.",
    "Every ported module against the seed, bit for bit (samples, schedules,",
    "graph outputs, findings, leases).",
    "Both builds are in one binary (the seed is a dev-dependency), so the",
    "harness times both arms itself (A B B A per epoch) and prints the pairs."
  ],
  "name": "vesper-resonance",
  "lane": "SH6-9",
  "rust": [
    "crates/vesper-resonance/seed/src/engine/confine.rs",
    "crates/vesper-resonance/seed/src/engine/kernels.rs",
    "crates/vesper-resonance/seed/src/engine/pdc.rs"
  ],
  "env": {
    "CARGO_PROFILE_DEV_DEBUG": "0",
    "CARGO_PROFILE_TEST_DEBUG": "0"
  },
  "build": [
    ["cargo", "build", "--locked", "--release", "-p", "vesper-resonance", "--example", "abba"]
  ],
  "tests": [
    {
      "run": ["cargo", "test", "--locked", "--release", "-p", "vesper-resonance", "-p", "vesper-resonance-seed"]
    }
  ],
  "differential": {
    "run": ["cargo", "test", "--locked", "--release", "-p", "vesper-resonance", "--test", "port_differential"]
  },
  "abba": [
    {
      "workload": "kernel",
      "run": {
        "cargo_target": "release/examples/abba",
        "args": ["flip-gate", "kernel"]
      }
    },
    {
      "workload": "graph",
      "run": {
        "cargo_target": "release/examples/abba",
        "args": ["flip-gate", "graph"]
      }
    },
    {
      "workload": "schedule",
      "run": {
        "cargo_target": "release/examples/abba",
        "args": ["flip-gate", "schedule"]
      }
    },
    {
      "workload": "pid",
      "run": {
        "cargo_target": "release/examples/abba",
        "args": ["flip-gate", "pid"]
      }
    },
    {
      "workload": "confine",
      "run": {
        "cargo_target": "release/examples/abba",
        "args": ["flip-gate", "confine"]
      }
    },
    {
      "workload": "confine-many",
      "run": {
        "cargo_target": "release/examples/abba",
        "args": ["flip-gate", "confine-many"]
      }
    }
  ]
}
